#: tools/virt-pki-query-dn.c:30
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Usage:\n"
"  %1$s FILE\n"
"  %2$s { -v | -h }\n"
"\n"
"Extract Distinguished Name from a PEM certificate.\n"
"The output is meant to be used in the tls_allowed_dn_list\n"
"configuration option in the libvirtd.conf file.\n"
"\n"
"  FILE            certificate file to extract the DN from\n"
"\n"
"options:\n"
"  -h | --help     display this help and exit\n"
"  -v | --version  output version information and exit\n"
msgstr ""
"Lietošana:\n"
"  %1$s FAILS\n"
"  %2$s { -v | -h }\n"
"\n"
"Izvilkt atšķirošo nosaukumu (DN) no PEM sertifikāta.\n"
"Izvade paredzēta izmantošanai tls_allowed_dn_list\n"
"konfigurācijas opcijā failā libvirtd.conf.\n"
"\n"
"  FAILS           sertifikāta fails, no kura izvilkt DN\n"
"\n"
"opcijas:\n"
"  -h | --help     parādīt šo palīdzību un iziet\n"
"  -v | --version  izvadīt versijas informāciju un iziet\n"

#: tools/virt-pki-validate.c:321
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Usage:\n"
"  %1$s { -v | -h } [TRUST|SERVER|CLIENT]\n"
"\n"
"Validate TLS certificate configuration\n"
"\n"
"options:\n"
"  -s     | --system   validate system certificates (default)\n"
"  -u     | --user     validate user certificates\n"
"  -p DIR | --path DIR validate custom certificate path\n"
"  -h     | --help     display this help and exit\n"
"  -v     | --version  output version information and exit\n"
msgstr ""
"Lietošana:\n"
"  %1$s { -v | -h } [TRUST|SERVER|CLIENT]\n"
"\n"
"Validēt TLS sertifikātu konfigurāciju\n"
"\n"
"opcijas:\n"
"  -s     | --system   validēt sistēmas sertifikātus (noklusējums)\n"
"  -u     | --user     validēt lietotāja sertifikātus\n"
"  -p DIR | --path DIR validēt pielāgotu sertifikātu ceļu\n"
"  -h     | --help     parādīt šo palīdzību un iziet\n"
"  -v     | --version  izvadīt versijas informāciju un iziet\n"

